---
const clients = [
  "Alita Construction Services",
  "ADM Home Services",
  "Pacific Premier Insurance Associates",
  "The Judge's Mansion",
];
---

<section class="clients dark" aria-label="Clients I have built for">
  <div class="wrap clients__inner">
    <p class="clients__label tag" data-reveal>Clients</p>
    <ul class="clients__list">
      {
        clients.map((c, i) => (
          <li data-reveal style={`--delay:${100 + i * 90}ms`}>
            {c}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section intro">
  <div class="wrap intro__grid">
    <div data-reveal>
      <h2>
        From the problem<br />to the <span class="accent">running system</span>.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="intro__body">
      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:120ms">
        I was hired as a digital marketing assistant. The founders I worked with kept bringing me
        operational problems instead: leads waiting days for a quote, field updates nobody typed in,
        tracking that counted failed forms as wins. So I started building the systems that fixed
        them.
      </p>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:200ms">
        Today I work directly with business owners. I find where the manual work is, build the
        automation on the tools they already pay for, test it against real data, and document it so
        it keeps running without me in the room.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .clients {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dark);
    padding-block: 34px;
  }

  .clients__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px 40px;
  }

  .clients__label {
    flex: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .clients__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 34px;
  }

  .clients__list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: rgba(233, 237, 247, 0.72);
    position: relative;
    transition: color 0.3s var(--ease);
  }

  .clients__list li:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .intro__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.95fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .intro__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .intro__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
